# Variáveis
@gateway = http://localhost:8082

### Health do gateway
GET {{gateway}}/s/api/gateway/_health
Accept: application/json

### 1) Criar usuário (Auth via gateway)
# @name createUser
POST {{gateway}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuario Gateway",
  "email": "usuario.gateway1@example.com",
  "password": "minhasenha123"
}

@userId = {{createUser.response.body.id}}

### 2) Login (Auth via gateway)
# @name login
POST {{gateway}}/auth/login/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario.gateway@example.com",
  "password": "minhasenha123"
}

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3) Criar evento (Events via gateway)
# @name createEvent
POST {{gateway}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Evento Gateway",
  "date": "2025-12-01T20:00:00",
  "venue": "São Januário"
}

@eventId = {{createEvent.response.body.id}}

### 4) Criar assentos para o evento (Ticket via gateway)
POST {{gateway}}/api/seats?eventId={{eventId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

[
  "A1",
  "A2"
]

### 5) Criar reserva (Ticket via gateway) -> salva {{reservationId}}
# @name createReservation
POST {{gateway}}/api/reservations?userId={{userId}}&eventId={{eventId}}&ttlSeconds=300
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

[
  "A1",
  "A2"
]

@reservationId = {{createReservation.response.body.id}}

### 6) Pagar (Payment via gateway) -> payment-service deve commitar a reserva em caso de sucesso
POST {{gateway}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "reservationId": "{{reservationId}}",
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "method": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "card": {
    "number": "4111111111111111",
    "expiry": "12/26",
    "cvv": "123"
  }
}

### 7) Verificar reserva (deve retornar 404 se pagamento comitou)
GET {{gateway}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8) Obter ticket(s) do usuário (deve conter ticket criado após commit)
GET {{gateway}}/api/tickets?ownerId={{userId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
